{"id":2295,"date":"2024-09-19T12:33:47","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:33:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2295"},"modified":"2025-10-02T09:46:07","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T09:46:07","slug":"cardboard-box-inserts","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-box-inserts\/","title":{"rendered":"Cardboard Box Inserts"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Wholesale Box Inserts in Custom Sizes and Styles<\/h2>\n<p>We at <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><strong><em>Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/em><\/strong><\/a> specialize in manufacturing <strong>custom cardboard box inserts<\/strong> designed to fit snugly inside your packaging and hold products securely in place. These inserts are built for structure, protection, and presentation. Whether you&#8217;re shipping fragile items, organizing multi-part kits, or packaging delicate products for retail, box inserts play a crucial role in product safety.<\/p>\n<p>Our <strong>cardboard box inserts wholesale<\/strong> are available in custom sizes, styles, and configurations based on your packaging goals. We support small and bulk orders with fast turnaround, free design support, and <strong>free nationwide shipping<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Protective and Organized Packaging with Box Inserts<\/h2>\n<h3>Prevent Shifting and Damage During Shipping<\/h3>\n<p>Cardboard inserts are used to stop products from moving around during transport. They also help prevent scratching, crushing, and collisions inside the box.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Keeps products separated and cushioned<\/li>\n<li>Maintains shape and alignment during transit<\/li>\n<li>Reduces return rates from damaged items<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>These <strong>packaging inserts for boxes<\/strong> are especially useful for cosmetics, candles, electronics, glassware, and medical devices.<\/p>\n<h3>Helps Build a Better Unboxing Experience<\/h3>\n<p>Inserts are not only practical\u2014they improve how products are displayed once opened. A well-fitted insert keeps each item in place and makes the overall presentation feel cleaner and more professional.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Divides the box into organized compartments<\/li>\n<li>Holds multiple SKUs or accessories together<\/li>\n<li>Custom printed or left blank depending on your needs<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Inserts can also be used to separate marketing cards, manuals, samples, or add-on items.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Cardboard Box Inserts<\/h2>\n<table style=\"height: 403px;\" width=\"877\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Description<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Insert Sizes<\/td>\n<td>Fully Custom \u2013 Fitted to Your Box Dimensions<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Options<\/td>\n<td>Corrugated, Kraft, Chipboard, Bux Board<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Coating Choices<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Print Options<\/td>\n<td>CMYK, PMS, One-Color, Inside Printing Available<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Insert Styles<\/td>\n<td>Die-cut Inserts, Folding Partitions, Layered Inserts, Pockets<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Application Types<\/td>\n<td>Product Separators, Bottle Holders, Retail Display Inserts<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Food Safe Options<\/td>\n<td>FDA-Compliant Coating Available<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Compatible With<\/td>\n<td>Folding Cartons, Mailer Boxes, Gift Boxes, Rigid Boxes<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MOQ<\/td>\n<td>Starts at 100 Units<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bulk Ordering<\/td>\n<td>Yes, Available for 500+ Units<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Proofing Options<\/td>\n<td>3D Mock-up, Flat Layout, Physical Sample<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Design Assistance<\/td>\n<td>Free Layout Help and Revisions Included<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shipping<\/td>\n<td>Free Nationwide Delivery on All Orders<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Cardboard Inserts for Packaging Across Industries<\/h2>\n<h3>Fits in All Box Types and Packaging Styles<\/h3>\n<p>Our <strong>cardboard inserts for boxes<\/strong> are made to fit inside a wide range of packaging styles including mailer boxes, two-piece boxes, seal-end cartons, and even magnetic closure boxes. These are widely used in various industries.<\/p>\n<p>Common industries that use <strong>box inserts for packaging<\/strong> include:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>Cosmetics \u2013 lipstick, serum bottles, compact mirrors<\/li>\n<li>Electronics \u2013 chargers, cables, earbuds, accessories<\/li>\n<li>Food and Beverage \u2013 chocolates, jars, dry food pouches<\/li>\n<li>Gift Packaging \u2013 custom kits, candle sets, retail bundles<\/li>\n<li>Apparel and Accessories \u2013 socks, jewelry, watches<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>In addition to typical inserts, we also provide <strong>cardboard inserts for bags<\/strong>, useful for maintaining bag shape or holding bagged items upright inside a shipping box.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3606\" data-end=\"3636\"><strong data-start=\"3606\" data-end=\"3634\">Industries Using Inserts<\/strong><\/p>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_1rjym_1\">\n<div class=\"group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3638\" data-end=\"4306\">\n<thead data-start=\"3638\" data-end=\"3707\">\n<tr data-start=\"3638\" data-end=\"3707\">\n<th data-start=\"3638\" data-end=\"3649\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong>Category<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3649\" data-end=\"3668\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong>Product Examples<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3668\" data-end=\"3686\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong>Material Choice<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3686\" data-end=\"3696\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong>Add-ons<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3696\" data-end=\"3707\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong>Purpose<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"3778\" data-end=\"4306\">\n<tr data-start=\"3778\" data-end=\"3913\">\n<td data-start=\"3778\" data-end=\"3790\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cosmetics<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3790\" data-end=\"3828\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Lipsticks, bottles, compact mirrors<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3828\" data-end=\"3849\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Kraft or chipboard<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3849\" data-end=\"3877\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Logo branding, soft-touch<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3877\" data-end=\"3913\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Keeps small fragile items secure<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"3914\" data-end=\"4050\">\n<td data-start=\"3914\" data-end=\"3928\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Electronics<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3928\" data-end=\"3956\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Chargers, cables, earbuds<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3956\" data-end=\"3982\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corrugated or Bux Board<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3982\" data-end=\"4013\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Anti-static coating, die-cut<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4013\" data-end=\"4050\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Prevents movement during shipping<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4051\" data-end=\"4174\">\n<td data-start=\"4051\" data-end=\"4069\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Food &amp; Beverage<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4069\" data-end=\"4097\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Chocolates, jars, pouches<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4097\" data-end=\"4115\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Food-safe board<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4115\" data-end=\"4149\" data-col-size=\"sm\">FDA coating, inserts with slots<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4149\" data-end=\"4174\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Safe product handling<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4175\" data-end=\"4306\">\n<td data-start=\"4175\" data-end=\"4193\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Apparel &amp; Gifts<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4193\" data-end=\"4219\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Jewelry, socks, watches<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4219\" data-end=\"4236\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Recycled board<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4236\" data-end=\"4268\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Divider inserts, pocket trays<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4268\" data-end=\"4306\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Better presentation &amp; organization<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Custom Printing and Material Options<\/h2>\n<h3>Printing, Coating, and Finish Choices<\/h3>\n<p>Depending on the presentation you want, inserts can be left unprinted or customized with your branding, logo, or usage instructions.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gloss coating adds a reflective finish<\/li>\n<li>Matte coating gives a clean, soft appearance<\/li>\n<li>Spot UV helps highlight specific areas or logos<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>We also use <strong>eco-friendly and recyclable materials<\/strong> like Kraft board for brands focusing on sustainability. Whether you want plain natural inserts or printed partitions, we help match your goals.<\/p>\n<h3>Match Insert Strength with Product Weight<\/h3>\n<p>Lighter products may only need chipboard or folded Kraft, while heavier or fragile items are better supported by double-layer corrugated inserts or die-cut boards.<\/p>\n<p>Our <strong>large cardboard box inserts<\/strong> are specially designed for heavier packaging like wine bottles, candle jars, glassware, and multi-item kits.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4746\" data-end=\"4781\"><strong data-start=\"4746\" data-end=\"4779\">Printing &amp; Material Selection<\/strong><\/p>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_1rjym_1\">\n<div class=\"group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"4783\" data-end=\"5413\">\n<thead data-start=\"4783\" data-end=\"4862\">\n<tr data-start=\"4783\" data-end=\"4862\">\n<th data-start=\"4783\" data-end=\"4794\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong>Category<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"4794\" data-end=\"4808\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong>Description<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"4808\" data-end=\"4827\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong>Printing Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"4827\" data-end=\"4847\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong>Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"4847\" data-end=\"4862\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong>Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"4942\" data-end=\"5413\">\n<tr data-start=\"4942\" data-end=\"5041\">\n<td data-start=\"4942\" data-end=\"4964\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Lightweight Inserts<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4964\" data-end=\"4987\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Best for small items<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4987\" data-end=\"4999\" data-col-size=\"sm\">CMYK, PMS<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4999\" data-end=\"5015\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Matte coating<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5015\" data-end=\"5041\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cosmetics, retail kits<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"5042\" data-end=\"5175\">\n<td data-start=\"5042\" data-end=\"5063\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Heavy-duty Inserts<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5063\" data-end=\"5096\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Supports fragile glass or jars<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5096\" data-end=\"5122\" data-col-size=\"sm\">One-color or full-color<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5122\" data-end=\"5150\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Gloss coating, lamination<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5150\" data-end=\"5175\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Wine bottles, candles<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"5176\" data-end=\"5281\">\n<td data-start=\"5176\" data-end=\"5199\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eco-friendly Inserts<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5199\" data-end=\"5223\" data-col-size=\"sm\">100% recyclable Kraft<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5223\" data-end=\"5239\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minimal print<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5239\" data-end=\"5256\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Natural finish<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5256\" data-end=\"5281\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Sustainable packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"5282\" data-end=\"5413\">\n<td data-start=\"5282\" data-end=\"5300\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Premium Inserts<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5300\" data-end=\"5333\" data-col-size=\"sm\">High-end look for luxury goods<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5333\" data-end=\"5361\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Inside &amp; outside printing<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5361\" data-end=\"5386\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Spot UV, foil stamping<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5386\" data-end=\"5413\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Perfume, gift packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Why Choose Cardboard Box Inserts Bulk Orders<\/h2>\n<h3>Scale Smartly with Cardboard Box Inserts Wholesale<\/h3>\n<p>Ordering <strong>cardboard box inserts in bulk<\/strong> gives you control over unit pricing, consistency, and turnaround times.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Save on per-unit cost for larger orders<\/li>\n<li>Create standard packaging across multiple products<\/li>\n<li>Avoid repeated reordering delays<\/li>\n<li>Store flat inserts with minimal space usage<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>We also offer <strong>custom box inserts<\/strong> to pair with different box styles or seasonal product bundles.<\/p>\n<p>If you&#8217;re ordering inserts for use in promotional or niche boxes, you may also want to review our <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/cardboard-boxes-for-specific-uses\/\">Cardboard Boxes For Specific Uses<\/a><\/strong>. This category includes solutions built for cosmetics, electronics, food, and other use-specific needs.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>How to Order Your Custom Inserts<\/h2>\n<h3>Start in Just a Few Simple Steps<\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Submit your box dimensions and product details<\/li>\n<li>Choose insert layout, strength, and print requirements<\/li>\n<li>Upload artwork or ask for free design help<\/li>\n<li>Review your 3D proof or sample<\/li>\n<li>Approve and receive inserts with free shipping<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>Each insert is designed to reduce waste, improve customer experience, and help keep packaging assembly simple and fast.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"196\" data-end=\"248\">Explore Related Solutions to Match Your Packaging<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"803\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">While <strong data-start=\"256\" data-end=\"281\">cardboard box inserts<\/strong> work to improve internal organization and product safety, external handling is just as important\u2014especially for retail packaging or takeaway boxes. If you&#8217;re looking for structural options that are easier to carry and transport, we also provide <strong data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"629\"><a class=\"cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-boxes-with-handle\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"627\">Cardboard Boxes With Handle<\/a><\/strong> designed for mobility, secure grip, and customer convenience. These can be paired with inserts to ensure both external strength and internal alignment for any product range.<\/p>\n<h2>Why Shop Cardboard Boxes is the Smart Choice<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Custom <strong>cardboard box inserts<\/strong> made to your box and product dimensions<\/li>\n<li>Available in all sizes including <strong>large cardboard box inserts<\/strong><\/li>\n<li>Coating options: Gloss, Matte, and Spot UV<\/li>\n<li>Free design support with mock-up proofs<\/li>\n<li>Eco-conscious material choices<\/li>\n<li>Bulk ordering with wholesale pricing<\/li>\n<li>Fast production times with nationwide delivery<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Request a free quote now and organize your packaging with professionally designed Cardboard Box Inserts from Shop Cardboard Boxes.<\/strong><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Shop Cardboard Boxes for high-quality Cardboard Box Inserts at wholesale prices. We offer various coating options like Gloss, Matte, and Spot UV to enhance your packaging&#8217;s look. Our free design and shipping services ensure a hassle-free experience. Take advantage of our free shipping and get your custom inserts today!<\/p>\n<div class=\"container\"><\/div>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2422,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[182],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2295","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-ca